            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayibamba ngesandla impumputhe, wayiyisa ngaphandle komuzi; wafela amathe emehlweni ayo, wabeka izandla zakhe phezu kwayo, wayibuza ukuthi ibona utho yini.",
