              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waqala ukubafundisa ukuthi iNdodana yomuntu imelwe ukuhlupheka ngokuningi, ilahlwe ngamalunga, nabapristi abakhulu, nababhali, ibulawe, ibuye ivuke emva kwezinsuku ezintathu.",
